config DRM_PRISMRV
	tristate "PrismRV DRM driver for PowerVR SGX GPUs"
	depends on MMU && (OF || COMPILE_TEST)
	depends on DRM
	select DRM_GEM_SHMEM_HELPER
	select PM_DEVFREQ
	select DEVFREQ_GOV_SIMPLE_ONDEMAND
	select PM_OPP
	help
	  Say Y here to enable a DRM render node for Imagination
	  PowerVR SGX GPUs as found in several ARM SoCs (e.g. the
	  MediaTek MT6589).  The core type and RTL revision are probed
	  at runtime, errata workarounds are applied per revision and
	  the microkernel firmware is loaded from userspace.

	  Firmware blobs go under prismrv/ in the firmware tree.

	  If unsure, say N.
